activity Collect Digital Evidence
activity Preserve Digital Evidence
activity Analyze Digital Evidence
activity Generate Evidence Report
activity Review Evidence Report
activity Authorize Evidence Release
activity Dispose Digital Evidence
activity Document Chain of Custody
activity Validate Evidence Integrity
activity Secure Evidence Storage
activity Report Security Breach
activity Audit Evidence Access
activity Index Digital Evidence
activity Update Evidence Metadata
activity Classify Digital Evidence
bind Collect Digital Evidence: Evidence Type, Evidence Size
bind Preserve Digital Evidence: Custody Status, Integrity Score
bind Analyze Digital Evidence: Security Level, Analysis Time
bind Dispose Digital Evidence: Disposal Method, Retention Period
bind Audit Evidence Access: Access Count, Legal Hold
Evidence Type: Document, Image, Video, Audio, Log File
Evidence Size: integer between 1 and 1000
Custody Status: Collected, Preserved, Analyzed, Released, Disposed
Integrity Score: float between 0.0 and 1.0
Security Level: Confidential, Restricted, Unclassified
Analysis Time: float between 0.1 and 24.0
Disposal Method: Shredding, Wiping, Deletion
Retention Period: integer between 30 and 3650
Access Count: integer between 0 and 100
Legal Hold: Yes, No
Init[Collect Digital Evidence] | |
End[Dispose Digital Evidence] | |
Succession[Collect Digital Evidence, Preserve Digital Evidence] | | |
Response[Preserve Digital Evidence, Analyze Digital Evidence] | | |
Existence[Analyze Digital Evidence] | |
Chain Response[Analyze Digital Evidence, Generate Evidence Report] | | |
Precedence[Analyze Digital Evidence, Document Chain of Custody] | | |
Chain Response[Preserve Digital Evidence, Validate Evidence Integrity] | | |
Co-Existence[Secure Evidence Storage, Validate Evidence Integrity] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Report Security Breach, Dispose Digital Evidence] | | |
Responded Existence[Collect Digital Evidence, Audit Evidence Access] |A.Legal Hold is Yes | |
Alternate Response[Review Evidence Report, Authorize Evidence Release] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Authorize Evidence Release, Dispose Digital Evidence] | | |
Choice[Index Digital Evidence, Update Evidence Metadata] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Classify Digital Evidence, Dispose Digital Evidence] | | |